  "179:93": {
    "inputs": {
      "text": "A cute soft 3D Todeok mascot with a round white head, a plump white body, small round black eyes, a yellow oval bill, a gray-beige cap on its head and short gray-beige feet, holding four colorful balloons, yellow, coral red, pastel green and sky blue, in its left hand. It walks calmly toward the camera at a steady pace along the center of the flat paved stone approach at the foot of the wide stone stairs, its feet alternating naturally and stepping firmly on the paving, with a gentle side-to-side weight shift. Its face stays turned toward the camera with a cheerful innocent expression, its small round black eyes wide open and its head level, and its round body keeps the same shape throughout. The same four balloons sway gently together, their strings always held in its hand, while its free arm stays close to its body. The tall pine trees move very slightly in the breeze. Behind it, the stone stairs rise to a red gate, a white stone fence and the grassy royal tomb mound, with wooden information signs on both sides of the path. Smooth tracking shot at eye level: the camera slowly and steadily pulls back as the mascot walks forward, keeping it centered at about the same size in the frame with the balloons fully visible, while the paved path and lawn edges glide past on both sides. Soft overcast daylight with gentle shading on the mascot and a soft shadow under its feet. Smooth matte 3D character in a realistic photographic landscape, cinematic, smooth and stable motion.",
